      "text": "APPOINTMENT OF A SPECIAL ASSISTANT TO\nTHE MAYOR TO EXERCISE THE FUNCTIONS,\nPOWERS AND DUTIES IMPOSED BY SECTION\n210 OF THE CIVIL SERVICE LAW.",
